{"words": [{"text": "۞ إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَأْمُرُكُمْ", "translation": "orders you"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "تُؤَدُّوا۟", "translation": "render"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَمَـٰنَـٰتِ", "translation": "the trusts"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "أَهْلِهَا", "translation": "their owners"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "and when"}, {"text": "حَكَمْتُم", "translation": "you judge"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "between"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "تَحْكُمُوا۟", "translation": "judge"}, {"text": "بِٱلْعَدْلِ ۚ", "translation": "with justice"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "نِعِمَّا", "translation": "excellently"}, {"text": "يَعِظُكُم", "translation": "advises you"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ ۗ", "translation": "with it"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "سَمِيعًۢا", "translation": "All-Hearing"}, {"text": "بَصِيرًۭا", "translation": "All-Seeing"}], "sahih": "Indeed, Allāh commands you to render trusts to whom they are due and when you judge between people to judge with justice. Excellent is that which Allāh instructs you. Indeed, Allāh is ever Hearing and Seeing."}